    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-κρημνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sheer, precipitous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος ἄβατον καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.176
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				3.111
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.31
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				37.4
			</span></i>: metaph. of an advocate's case, <i>full of difficulties,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα ἀ. ὁρῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					25.76
				</span></i>
			.</div>
